<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-050" chapter-id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi" source-id="s-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi-ws2371899">
  <p id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">父<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0001" ref="ykp_uqh_6be">仲子</persName>，由<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0005" ref="ykp_uqh_6be_A">興世</persName>致位給事中。<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0013" ref="ykp_uqh_6be_A">興世</persName>欲將往襄陽，愛戀鄉里，不肯去。嘗謂<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0032" ref="ykp_uqh_6be_A">興世</persName>：「我雖田舍老公，樂聞鼓角，可送一部，行田時吹之。」<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0060" ref="ykp_uqh_6be_A">興世</persName>素恭謹畏法憲，譬之曰：「此是天子鼓角，非田舍老公所吹。」<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0090" ref="ykp_uqh_6be_A">興世</persName>欲拜墓，<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0096" ref="ykp_uqh_6be">仲子</persName>謂曰：「汝衞從太多，先人必當驚怖。」<persName id="c-songshu-050-zhang-zhongzi:p001:m0116" ref="ykp_uqh_6be_A">興世</persName>減撤而後行。</p>
</text>
